      "body_html": "<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/rikosellic/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/rikosellic\">@rikosellic</a> Looking into this API this might be unsound for Asterinas to create an empty <code class=\"notranslate\">Rcu</code> because we should have <code class=\"notranslate\">RcuOption</code> which represents this semantic. I think for vanilla <code class=\"notranslate\">Rcu</code>s we should never allow them to be nullable? How do you htink?</p>",
